ment-because-the-trial-court-failed-to-ensure-a-unanimous-verdict)1273 0 R(jury-instructions--deliberations)1258 0 R(sentencing)1259 0 R(standard-of-review)1260 0 R(statement-of-issues-on-appeal)1254 0 R(statement-of-the-case)1255 0 R(v-martins-four-year-prison-sentence-for-nonviolent-and-nondestructive-conduct-is-grossly-disproportionate-and-violates-the-eighth-amendment)1277 0 R]>>>>>>
